# ── Gate measurement ────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Every gate below used to be a string literal in this file. Four of them read
# "UNVERIFIED" and MODEL_BINDING read "CONSTITUTION_DRIFT", so `fully_sealed`
# could never evaluate true no matter what the verifiers reported — the Mind
# Conduit was structurally incapable of sealing and every DCX invocation failed
# MIND_CONDUIT_NOT_SEALED. These functions replace the literals with the result
# of actually running, or actually reading, each gate's verifier.
#
# The direction of failure is unchanged: anything that cannot be measured, is
# stale, or fails, returns a non-sealing value. This makes the gates honest in
# both directions, not permissive.

